# Virtual environments
.venv

# Secrets -- never commit real credentials.
# See PROJECT_AUDIT.md (finding C2) / TECHNICAL_DEBT.md (TD-2): this repo
# previously had no rule excluding `.env`, which is one commit away from
# leaking real Azure/LangSmith credentials. Use `.env.example` as the
# template for a local `.env`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

